    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "body": "When the toktok-releaser script (tools/create_release.py) fails (e.g., when a milestone still has open issues in stage_production_ready), it currently terminates with a traceback and provides no feedback in the release tracking issue.\n\nThe script should be updated to:\n1. Catch exceptions during the release process.\n2. Post a comment to the release tracking issue explaining the failure.\n3. Update the \"Release progress\" dashboard to indicate that action is required.\n4. Reassign the issue to the human.",
